1
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:45,860
Hey,

2
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:48,630
why did you bring me to a place like this?

3
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:49,960
Don't be so impatient.

4
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:52,260
Go check the private room on the right.

5
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:57,730
You mean here?

6
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,000
Chief,

7
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,730
it's been so long.

8
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,600
Did you miss me?

9
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,400
Did you call me here

10
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:15,000
just to say this?

11
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,800
Oh,

12
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,560
don't be so cold.

13
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:24,360
So this is the type

14
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,160
he likes.

15
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:28,600
Who's there?

16
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:31,800
Girl,

17
00:01:32,229 --> 00:01:33,200
why is she here?

18
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:36,200
And she's with that boy
from Yungong Pavilion.

19
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:38,900
Chief, you...

20
00:01:45,030 --> 00:01:45,600
Girl,

21
00:01:46,229 --> 00:01:47,560
what are you doing here?

22
00:01:50,729 --> 00:01:51,630
Chief,

23
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,229
who is this girl?

24
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:55,160
You haven't introduced us yet.

25
00:01:58,630 --> 00:01:59,729
Just passing by.

26
00:01:59,830 --> 00:02:01,760
Sorry to interrupt your fun, Mr. Yan.

27
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,760
Please continue.

28
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:10,860
I was actually foolish enough
to think he liked me.

29
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:17,820
This girl brought another man
to the restaurant

30
00:02:17,829 --> 00:02:19,690
and didn't even explain herself.

31
00:02:25,130 --> 00:02:27,560
Let go. You're hurting me.

32
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:28,930
Come back with me.

33
00:02:28,930 --> 00:02:30,860
No, let me go.

34
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:43,829
Let me go.

35
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:44,829
I can walk by myself.

36
00:02:44,829 --> 00:02:45,960
Don't pull me.

37
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:48,930
Let's go.

38
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,360
I'm afraid you can't leave.

39
00:02:58,530 --> 00:02:59,329
Hmph,

40
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,000
long time no see.

41
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,530
By order of the High Priest,

42
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:05,060
you must die here.

43
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,260
Hei Wuya,

44
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:11,830
you joined the Demonic Cult?

45
00:03:12,130 --> 00:03:13,860
Hmph, cut the crap.

46
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,660
Brothers, attack!

47
00:03:16,329 --> 00:03:17,130
Kill!

48
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,000
Don't worry.

49
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,460
I'll protect you this time.

50
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:31,230
He actually didn't just stand by
and watch this time.

51
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:47,360
Didn't they say he was seriously injured?

52
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,600
Damn it.

53
00:03:50,329 --> 00:03:51,130
Ah!

54
00:03:55,230 --> 00:03:55,930
Stop!

55
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:56,630
Let's

56
00:03:56,660 --> 00:03:57,730
go after them.

57
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,800
Ah!

58
00:04:02,330 --> 00:04:03,130
What's

59
00:04:03,630 --> 00:04:04,660
wrong?

60
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:06,160
Don't scare me.

61
00:04:09,130 --> 00:04:11,400
Madam, Senior Medical Maniac is not here.

62
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,530
I heard you became his apprentice
a long time ago.

63
00:04:13,530 --> 00:04:14,990
We can only rely on you now.

64
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,890
I'll figure something out.

65
00:04:21,459 --> 00:04:22,130
Oh,

66
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:24,260
why are you calling her Madam?

67
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:26,190
Does she deserve it?

68
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:28,930
Besides, I think

69
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,960
the Chief is like this

70
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:32,960
all because of her.

71
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,430
It's you.

72
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:38,600
Who exactly are you?

73
00:04:38,730 --> 00:04:40,530
Stop making false accusations.

74
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:42,720
You really are a wild girl,

75
00:04:42,930 --> 00:04:44,330
not even recognizing me.

76
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,330
I am Feng Qingwu,

77
00:04:46,330 --> 00:04:47,460
one of the Ten Halls of Yanmen.

78
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:50,030
A piece of trash like you
who only brings disaster to the Chief

79
00:04:50,030 --> 00:04:51,530
dares to call herself Madam?

80
00:04:51,530 --> 00:04:53,060
I didn't call myself Madam.

81
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,360
So noisy.

82
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:00,690
Is this how you care for a patient?

83
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:05,000
Sect Leader, you're awake.

84
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,960
Let me help you.

85
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:09,000
No need. Feng,

86
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,660
take her out.

87
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:14,460
Ah, Sect Leader, don't be so heartless.

88
00:05:22,330 --> 00:05:23,790
Why won't you turn around?

89
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,730
Where did your bravado go?

90
00:05:28,130 --> 00:05:31,630
My dear wife.
